### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priyansh",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "organization": "PhishTrack Labs"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### Verify OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "PASTE_USER_ID_HERE",
  "otp": "PASTE_OTP_HERE"
}

### Get Me (protected)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE


### Create Case
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Suspicious phishing site",
  "description": "Phishing site mimicking bank login",
  "reporterEmail": "test@example.com"
}

### Get All Cases
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cases

### Get Case by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cases/{{CASE_ID}}
